 *   paper    TYPE=PAPER   PAPER_CUSTOM_JAR=<jar>                  (start-deployPaper: skips mc-image-helper install-paper)
 *   folia    TYPE=FOLIA   PAPER_CUSTOM_JAR=<jar>                  (start-deployFolia execs start-deployPaper)
 *   purpur   TYPE=CUSTOM  CUSTOM_SERVER=<jar>  FAMILY=SPIGOT      (start-deployPurpur has no local-file option)
 *   fabric   TYPE=FABRIC  FABRIC_LAUNCHER=<jar>                   (install-fabric-loader --from-local-file)
 *   forge    TYPE=FORGE   FORGE_INSTALLER=<jar>                   (ProvidedInstallerResolver: version read from the jar)
